engine/ is the upstream snapshot root. Paths below are relative to that root
and match their upstream paths. It contains the complete upstream engine/
plus the room/ and harness/ dependencies of its generation loop, and the
upstream tokenizer reference fixture at tests/unit/tokenizer_llamacpp.json.
JavaScript files have one added origin comment; all remaining bytes are
unchanged. The JSON reference fixture and LICENSE-ENGINE are unmodified.
The tokenizer fixture was generated upstream with llama.cpp; it contains
vocabulary subsets and reference token IDs, not model weights.

The package manifest, tests and integration documentation are Paxeer work.
Future local runtime changes belong in src/, outside the vendored snapshot.

